    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1463830/extras/91286ceba16158ac19cc3fd59b94098f.poster.avif?t=1744990984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1463830/extras/91286ceba16158ac19cc3fd59b94098f.webm?t=1744990984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1463830/extras/91286ceba16158ac19cc3fd59b94098f.mp4?t=1744990984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>As a fresh graduate of the Earth Aviation Academy, you are assigned to the distant edge of known space. Investigate strange colonist behavior and deal with unknown threats in the ZPDN-A sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hone your piloting skills, expand your arsenal, and complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1463830/extras/27379b0383b70404c62dafa09881121b.avif?t=1744990984\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 stunning levels - explore colorful alien worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn points and exchange them for ammunition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your arsenal as you go - Impulse gun, missiles, plasma gun, mines, homing shells, laser gun, energy shield, and Perun's Exhalation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets lurking in space - Find and kill eight alien fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from three classes of spaceships to best suit your play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against challenging bosses in each level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also in the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escort and protect the cargo ship </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free colonists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1463830/extras/91286ceba16158ac19cc3fd59b94098f.poster.avif?t=1744990984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1463830/extras/91286ceba16158ac19cc3fd59b94098f.webm?t=1744990984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1463830/extras/91286ceba16158ac19cc3fd59b94098f.mp4?t=1744990984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>As a fresh graduate of the Earth Aviation Academy, you are assigned to the distant edge of known space. Investigate strange colonist behavior and deal with unknown threats in the ZPDN-A sector.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hone your piloting skills, expand your arsenal, and complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1463830/extras/27379b0383b70404c62dafa09881121b.avif?t=1744990984\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 stunning levels - explore colorful alien worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn points and exchange them for ammunition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your arsenal as you go - Impulse gun, missiles, plasma gun, mines, homing shells, laser gun, energy shield, and Perun's Exhalation!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets lurking in space - Find and kill eight alien fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from three classes of spaceships to best suit your play style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against challenging bosses in each level</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Also in the game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Escort and protect the cargo ship </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free colonists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Vostok 2061 is a modern-graphics vertical scroll shooter. Gorgeous alien worlds, spaceships, and bosses. Explore mysteries as you listen to a great soundtrack!",
